        "TileImage": "$($repository ecc907c9-5e40-4bc2-b492-9bef5c49cd64).Image",
        "Description": "Mr. Breunmann and Mr. Durand have peddled shark fins from endangered species to competitive racers for far too long. It is time to end their illegal trade by dispatching them without discrimination. They will be at the medic building, providing you a clean getaway using the ambulance right outside of it. You will be given a bonus if you dispatch them with an unsilenced weapon to send a clear message. Good luck 47.",
